Cell["\<\
A lower polarization level, or a symbolic polarization level, may be \
specified:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.681107981147118*^9, 
  3.681107993139248*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9abb9faa-7b51-45c2-9218-\
